    "No region may overlap the eight slot rectangles (slot rect = center +/- size/2). Piles, Energy, Stadium and the NPC hand fan live inside protectedCards; the player plates (photo + points) sit in the screen corners and the floating action buttons below End Turn, outside protectedCards.",
    "Interface sections 23.5 (1920x1080) and 23.14 (1280x720) mirror every region of this file; change both together.",
    "Camera and world seeds are per profile (calibrated so the eight projected slots meet their screen targets); fitBounds still runs after layout. At 720p the near rim may be cut by about 14 px, a cosmetic margin allowed by runtime section 14.9; cards and controls are never cut."
